### Color

The primary accent with a soft track by default; `current_color: true` adopts the text color.

<%= embed AppicaUI::LoaderPreview, :color %>

### Load more

A "load more" button shows the dots loader while the next page fetches; `current_color:` matches the button text.

<%= embed AppicaUI::LoaderPreview, :load_more %>

### Section loading

Show a centered loader while a panel's data is in flight, then swap in the content.

<%= embed AppicaUI::LoaderPreview, :section %>

With Turbo, a lazy frame's placeholder content is exactly this spot:

```erb
<%%= turbo_frame_tag "revenue", src: revenue_path, loading: :lazy do %>
  <%%= render AppicaUI::Loader.new(class: "text-4xl") %>
<%% end %>
```

### Inline status

Sized in `em` with `current_color:`, a loader sits on the line next to a "syncing…" message.

